{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】一股東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。此外，覆蓋該區的雲帶預料會在今日轉薄。本港地區今日(11月27日)天氣預測，初時部分時間多雲。日間漸轉天晴，市區最高氣溫約25度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。</p>\n<p>展望周末期間至下周初大致天晴。星期六非常乾燥。星期日風勢頗大。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:24:17.312214+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:02:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:17:47.565763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:17:47.565763+00:00","content_hash":"cbafb65d0cea5e9573a0ae42e8eba11c361440a917e9ff4b86485c666f57e2a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}